 "notes": [
  "The post's 'Start' section lists Heading For The Medical Frigate, Strike Planning, Squadass (Squadron Assignments) and 'Usually Battle Plan (depends, I may put in Menace Fades though against RalOp or TDIGWATT)'; all of these are already in the main list, so the Start section is not counted twice. No single starting Effect is named, so none is set.",
  "The list totals 58 cards as published (not 60).",
  "Posted 'Objective Rebel Strike Team/Garrison not Destroyed' dested Rebel Strike Team / Garrison Destroyed.",
  "Posted 'GS 1' and 'GS 3' dested Green Squadron 1 and Green Squadron 3 (A-wings): there is no Gold Squadron 3, and the deck also runs Green Leader and Tycho Celchu (who flew Green Squadron 3). 'GS 1' could also be Gold Squadron 1.",
  "Posted 'Squadass' dested Squadron Assignments; 'Chewie's Gun' dested Chewbacca's Bowcaster (the only Chewbacca weapon of the era); 'Kensaric', 'Greeve', 'Junkin' dested Corporal Kensaric, Lieutenant Greeve, Sergeant Junkin; 'Chief Chirpa's Hutt' dested Endor: Chief Chirpa's Hut.",
  "The post's NOTE ('When I get Tala 1 and Blount they will be in here') and the 23 April update (cards taken out and added, including Tala 1, Tala 2, Lt. Blount and Coruscant) are not reflected in the list; the list is as first posted.",
  "Description says the deck was being prepared for the NC (North Carolina) State Championship; no result is given."
 ]
